<title>HONG KONG: Solidbank sets US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Solidbank sets US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the arrangers.</p>
<p> BORROWER SOLIDBANK CORP			 GUARANTOR   - -</p>
<p> AMT	US$50 MLN   COUPON    3ML+85 BP  MATURITY    3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    03.JAN.97</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE*	 CALLS     NONE	 REPLIES     22.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	US$100K</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	  SALE LMTS US/UK/SINGAPORE/PHILIPPINES</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY PHILIPPINE TAX PROV    TAX CALL</p>
<p>PAY DATE 28.FEB.97 TENTATIVE</p>
<p> NOTES    *HOLDERS' PUT OPTION AT MATERIAL ADVERSE CHANGE IN</p>
<p>	    SHAREHOLDING* CLEARING THROUGH EUROCLEAR, CEDEL.</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES  CO-LEADS  US$4 MLN+  22.5 BP ALL-IN 92.5</p>
<p>			    SNR MGRS  US$2-4 MLN 19.5 BP ALL-IN 91.5</p>
<p>ARRANGER BANK OF NOVA SCOTIA ASIA (BOOKS), DRESDNER SOUTHEAST</p>
<p>	    ASIA, SAKURA FINANCE ASIA (BOOKS).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
